// =============================================================================
// Chora Payments — User Subscription events (Stripe Subscriptions API)
// =============================================================================
//
// Aggregate root: UserSubscription (Stripe Subscription for a per-learner
//                 Companion mana subscription — Basic / Standard / Premium
//                 monthly or annual, per ADR-142 + ADR-149 amendment).
// Owning domain : Payments (chora_payments DB, per ADR-164).
// Topic prefix  : chora.payments.user_subscription.*
//
// Replaces (post Wave 1 Stage E cutover):
//   chora.identity.user_subscription.created.v1
//   chora.identity.user_subscription.activated.v1
//   chora.identity.user_subscription.paused.v1
//   chora.identity.user_subscription.cancelled.v1
//   (renewal events did not previously have their own topic; added here for
//    parity with the payments family).
//
// Lifecycle is richer than one-shot Checkouts: a single subscription has
// 9 event types:
//   5 payment-lifecycle: {checkout_started, payment_captured, payment_failed,
//                         refunded, expired}
//   4 subscription-lifecycle: {created, renewed, paused, cancelled}
//
// Originating-service notification path: chora-identity subscribes to ALL
// 9 topics and drives the existing `UserSubscription` aggregate FSM in
// `services/chora-identity/internal/domain/user_subscription/`.
